WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:01.926
It's 2023.

00:01.986 --> 00:03.762
An employee asks the company's new

00:03.762 --> 00:05.862
AI assistant about a contract.

00:05.875 --> 00:07.745
It answers, sure of itself,

00:07.745 --> 00:08.927
and wrong.

00:09.000 --> 00:10.265
A model knows only its

00:10.265 --> 00:12.191
training data and its prompt.

00:12.471 --> 00:14.118
It never read your documents.

00:14.480 --> 00:16.790
Since 2020, the fix has a name:

00:16.790 --> 00:17.752
RAG.

00:17.800 --> 00:18.948
So build one.

00:19.007 --> 00:21.293
Give the assistant the company documents.

00:21.353 --> 00:23.384
Still made up: nothing carries the

00:23.384 --> 00:25.066
right ones to the model.

00:25.300 --> 00:26.575
Add a retriever.

00:26.937 --> 00:28.632
Now the answer is correct,

00:28.632 --> 00:30.894
and it cites the policy it used.

00:31.500 --> 00:34.284
Retrieve, augment, generate.

00:34.400 --> 00:36.116
Then the whole pipeline is yours.

00:36.478 --> 00:39.334
47 documents, every block to rewire,

00:39.334 --> 00:40.969
break and fix.

00:41.400 --> 00:43.163
RAG, on Tinker.

00:43.223 --> 00:44.904
Start with chapter 1.
